combat behavior for a truly immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Cadet training, climb the ranks, earn medals, and aim for the elite title of <strong>World's Greatest Fighter Pilot (WGFP)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365620/extras/bd64ddde468d72cd7750fcf4f6a1ba1f.avif?t=1768345573\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience scripted missions and multiplayer campaigns based on legendary battles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle of Britain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pearl Harbor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B-17s over Europe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365620/extras/a979525e8bc1468c1829a18ee9c28f44.avif?t=1768345573\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WarBirds 2026 is a <strong>true simulation</strong>, not an arcade game. Every aircraft is meticulously modelled. You will need to master realistic flight physics, engine management, and WWII tactics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New features in WarBirds 2026 include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely revamped <strong>User Interface</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded <strong>graphics and effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved <strong>controller and flight support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365620/extras/b589b9a670dfdc1e7f2d79e5657d263c.avif?t=1768345573\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First 4 Weeks Free</strong>: Access the full suite of aircraft and features.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, keep playing <strong>for free</strong> with six early war vehicles like the <u><strong>Spitfire Mk. IIa</strong></u><strong>, <u>Me-109E-3</u>, <u>Ju-52</u>, <u>Do-17</u>, <u>Wellington Mk. 1C</u> , and <u>M4A1 Sherman,</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more? Subscriptions unlock full access again to over 400 accurate and historical Squadron Paint Schemes, over 500 different vehicles, and all the Ammo and Fuel you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Community</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train with real pilots</strong> in Thursday night sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join a Squadron</strong> to participate in organized raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete for honors and ranks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full access to Discord</strong> voice chat and community support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
